        walkthrough = '1. Visit the Windurstian Embassy in Ru\'Lude Gardens and speak with Pakh Jatalfih (I-9) for a cutscene.\n2. Go to the Audience Chamber in Ru\'Lude Gardens (H-6) for another cutscene.\n3. Speak with Aldo in Neptune\'s Spire in Lower Jeuno.\n   - Requires Tenshodo membership (from the "Tenshodo Membership" quest in Lower Jeuno).\n4. Obtain the three magicites from separate dungeons:\n   - Magicite: Optistone — Monastic Cavern in Davoi\n   - Magicite: Orastone — Altar Room in Castle Oztroja\n   - Magicite: Aurastone — Qulun Dome in Beadeaux\n   - Each dungeon requires specific key items to access the magicite rooms.\n5. After collecting all three, return to the Audience Chamber (H-5) in Ru\'Lude Gardens for a cutscene.\n6. Speak with Pakh Jatalfih to complete the mission.',
